pose.material3.version to v1.5.0-beta02 (#3551) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency androidx.palette:palette to v1.1.0 (#3552) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency androidx.webkit:webkit to v1.18.0 (#3553) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency com.google.firebase:firebase-bom to v35.0.1 (#3536) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency com.google.firebase:firebase-bom to v35.0.2 (#3543) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency com.google.firebase:firebase-bom to v35.1.0 (#3554) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency io.kotest:kotest-assertions-core-jvm to v6.2.6 (#3537) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update dependency org.conscrypt:conscrypt-android to v2.8.0 (#3549) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update okhttpversion to v5.5.1 (#3555) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- chore: update serializationversion to v1.12.0 (#3544) (@renovate[bot])\r\n- docs: remove completed reader architecture proposals\r\n- test: check the queue lock on the notifying thread (#3538) (@mods-hd)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Downloads & Checksums\r\n| Variant     | SHA-256 Checksum |\r\n|:------------|:-----------------|\r\n| `arm64-v8a` | `4365d95b6b945adf311051144bd04f51622f4672ac2e8fb50604453e55c5032d` |\r\n| `armeabi-v7a` | `2e49c804dfe186eee7288772764c91107dd44fc359172356b56ea3c5f631062a` |\r\n| `universal` | `ddef98e959a84aa9a881c368e45c4e5b68ec4153fd9456cc5f8e51d493283923` |\r\n| `x86` | `70c31e46c3bf1a07f63a21e53ad35fe76cf01fe9ae4b612a77e3f02b3f457364` |\r\n| `x86_64` | `ed2d3ca52ab4cf089b21234d86f91a6d6f4b4b427fca9fcbdacd13884961588a` |", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nekomangaorg/Neko/releases/413710102/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 1, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "mentions_count": 3}}